<p>You open all steam valves at once, releasing a radius 3 wave of superheated steam around yourself which deals <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>steampower 100">204, 274, 329, 375, 416</acronym> fire damage (but can not be a critical hit).</p><p>If you had at least 35 steam, the vapours will be so hot that they can burn sensory organs, blinding affected creatures for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 2, 3, 4, 4</acronym> turns.</p><p>The effects scale with your current steam value; at 1 steam they are only 15% as effective as at 50 or more (current factor 100%).</p>